Title: Judge's X Word Puzzle No. 7
Author: Mrs. Elizabeth D. York
Date: 1927-06-11
Byline: Submitted by Mrs. Elizabeth D. York, Washington, D. C. Judge pays $10 for each puzzle printed.
Source: https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1927-06-11_92/page/n31/mode/1up
Puzzle-Number: 7
Solution-Source: https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1927-06-18_92/page/n31/mode/1up


